.el .ds Aq '
.TH "bead recurrence list" 1  "bead recurrence list " 
.SH NAME
bead recurrence list \- List all recurrence templates
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead recurrence list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List all recurrence templates in the workspace with their basic configuration
and occurrence counts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
